## 🏗️ ARCHITECTURE RULES

### General
- Follow Clean Architecture with strict layer separation.
- Domain layer must NEVER import Flutter or external packages.
- Data layer depends on domain; presentation depends on domain only.
- Every feature is self-contained under `features/<name>/`.

### Dependency Injection
- Use `flutter_riverpod` with `@riverpod` code generation OR `get_it` + `injectable`.
- Providers/services must be scoped correctly — avoid global mutable state.

### State Management (Riverpod preferred)
```dart
// CORRECT — AsyncNotifier for async state
@riverpod
class UserNotifier extends _$UserNotifier {
  @override
  FutureOr<User> build() => ref.watch(userRepositoryProvider).getUser();

  Future<void> refresh() async {
    state = const AsyncLoading();
    state = await AsyncValue.guard(() => ref.read(userRepositoryProvider).getUser());
  }
}

// CORRECT — consuming state
ref.watch(userNotifierProvider).when(
  data: (user) => UserCard(user: user),
  loading: () => const AppLoader(),
  error: (e, _) => ErrorView(message: e.toString()),
);
```

