## 🚫 ANTI-PATTERNS (never do these)

- ❌ `setState` inside `ConsumerWidget` or when a provider exists
- ❌ Business logic inside widget `build()` methods
- ❌ Raw `Map<String, dynamic>` passed between layers
- ❌ Catching generic `Exception` without rethrowing typed failures
- ❌ `Navigator.of(context).push(MaterialPageRoute(...))` — use GoRouter
- ❌ Hardcoded strings in widgets — use `AppStrings` or l10n
- ❌ Calling `ref.read` inside `build()` — use `ref.watch`
- ❌ `print()` for logging — use the `logger` package
- ❌ `late` variables without initialization guarantee
- ❌ Ignoring `Either` results without handling the `Left` case

